      r: ['Correct. Small, regular amounts of preferred fluids, measured exactly.', 'Incorrect. Never withhold fluids to prevent incontinence.', 'Incorrect. Caffeine increases fluid loss.', 'Incorrect. Intake must be measured, not estimated.'],
      ask: 'What can the AP safely do to keep fluids going in?', cues: ['Older adult', 'Risk for dehydration'],
