      r: ['Correct. Stop the potassium reaching the tissue; then remove the catheter, notify the provider, and document with a photograph.', 'Incorrect. Not before the infusion is stopped.', 'Incorrect. Any potassium leaking into tissue causes damage.', 'Incorrect. Flushing pushes more fluid into the tissue.'],
      ask: 'What stops the damage right now?', cues: ['Swelling, coolness, burning', 'Potassium infusing'],
