      o: ['“I’ll take it with breakfast.”', '“I’ll take it on an empty stomach at bedtime.”', '“I can use a salt substitute instead of the pills.”', '“I’ll crush the extended-release tablet into juice.”'], a: [0],
      r: ['Correct. Taking it with or after a meal reduces its bad taste and nausea.', 'Incorrect. On an empty stomach it causes nausea and GI irritation.', 'Incorrect. A salt substitute is not a measured, prescribed dose.', 'Incorrect. Crushing an extended-release tablet releases the dose at once and irritates the gut.'],
