      r: ['Correct. ACE inhibitors make less angiotensin II: less vasoconstriction, less aldosterone, more sodium and water excreted.', 'Incorrect. The opposite.', 'Incorrect. ADH isn’t its target.', 'Incorrect. It lowers aldosterone.'],
      ask: 'Which step of the RAAS does an ACE inhibitor block?', cues: ['Lisinopril = ACE inhibitor'],
