      r: ['Correct. When a client with hyponatremia has muscle weakness, check breathing at once — the respiratory muscles may be weakening too.', 'Incorrect. Diet may help mild hyponatremia later; it isn’t the first action.', 'Incorrect. Unsafe — weakness raises the fall risk.', 'Incorrect. Waiting ignores a possible breathing problem now.'],
      ask: 'If the leg muscles are weak, which other muscles might be?', cues: ['Na⁺ 126', 'New muscle weakness'],
